{"schemaVersion":1,"articles":[{"id":"monsters.monster.retainer.statblock.orc-charger","title":"Орк-налётчик","chapter":"24. Помощники","group":"Помощники","path":"Monsters/monster/retainer/statblock/orc-charger.md","originalId":"mcdm.monsters.v1/monster.retainer.statblock/orc-charger","originalName":"Orc Charger","originalDescription":"|   Humanoid, Orc   |         -         |      Level 1      |   Harrier Retainer    |         EV -         |\n|:-----------------:|:-----------------:|:-----------------:|:---------------------:|:--------------------:|\n|  **1M**<br>Size   |  **8**<br>Speed   | **21**<br>Stamina |  **0**<br>Stability   | **3**<br>Free Strike |\n| **-**<br>Immunity | **-**<br>Movement |         -         | **-**<br>With Captain |  **-**<br>Weakness   |\n|  **+2**<br>Might  | **+2**<br>Agility |  **0**<br>Reason  |  **0**<br>Intuition   |  **0**<br>Presence   |\n\n> ⚔️ **Notched Axe (Signature Ability)**\n>\n> | **Charge, Melee, Ranged, Strike, Weapon** |               **[Main action](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/turn)** |\n> |-------------------------------------------|------------------------------:|\n> | **📏 Melee 1 or ranged 5**                | **🎯 One creature or object** |\n>\n> **Power Roll + highest characteristic:**\n>\n> - **≤11:** 3 damage\n> - **12-16:** 5 damage\n> - **17+:** 7 damage\n\n> ⭐️ **Relentless**\n>\n> If the charger is reduced to 0 [Stamina](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.health/stamina), they can make a [free strike](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/feature.common.main-actions/free-strike) before dying. If the target of the [free strike](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/feature.common.main-actions/free-strike) is reduced to 0 [Stamina](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.health/stamina), the charger is reduced to 1 [Stamina](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.health/stamina) instead.","director":{"section":"retainers","sourcePath":"monster/retainer/statblock/orc-charger.json","sourceRevision":"bdb12093b1d07bf8674453796eac907a09dd7dd3","groupSlug":"retainer","recordType":"statblock","level":1,"ev":"-","size":"1M","keywords":["Гуманоид","Орк"],"role":"Налётчик","organization":"Помощник"},"blocks":[{"type":"entity","ref":"monster.retainer.statblock.orc-charger"},{"type":"entity","ref":"monster.retainer.advancement-features.orc-charger"},{"type":"entity","ref":"monster.retainer.role-advancement.harrier"}],"related":[{"id":"monsters.monster.retainer.advancement-features.orc-charger","title":"Способности развития орка-налётчика"},{"id":"monsters.monster.retainer.role-advancement.harrier","title":"Способности развития роли Налётчика"},{"id":"monsters.chapter.retainers","title":"Помощники"},{"id":"monsters.guide.retainer-advancement","title":"Таблица развития помощников"}],"originalCoverage":{"status":"complete"}}],"entities":[{"id":"monster.retainer.statblock.orc-charger","kind":"retainer","name":"Орк-налётчик","markdown":"| Гуманоид, Орк | - | Уровень 1 | Помощник-налётчик | Боевая ценность - |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **1M**<br>Размер | **8**<br>Скорость | **21**<br>Выносливость | **0**<br>Устойчивость | **3**<br>Свободный удар |\n| **-**<br>Иммунитет | **-**<br>Перемещение | - | **-**<br>С капитаном | **-**<br>Уязвимость |\n| **+2**<br>Мощь | **+2**<br>Ловкость | **0**<br>Разум | **0**<br>Интуиция | **0**<br>Присутствие |\n\n> ⚔️ **Зазубренный топор (Знаковая способность)**\n>\n> | **Рывок, ближний бой, дальний бой, удар, оружие** | **[Основное действие](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.turn)** |\n> |---|---:|\n> | **📏 Ближний бой 1 или дальний бой 5** | **🎯 Одно существо или объект** |\n>\n> **Бросок силы + наивысшая характеристика:**\n>\n> - **≤11:** 3 урона\n> - **12-16:** 5 урона\n> - **17+:** 7 урона\n\n> ⭐️ **Неумолимость**\n>\n> Если [Выносливость](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.stamina) налётчика снижается до 0, он может совершить [свободный удар](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.free-strike) перед смертью. Если [Выносливость](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.stamina) цели этого [свободного удара](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.free-strike) снижается до 0, [Выносливость](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.stamina) налётчика вместо этого снижается до 1.\n","source":{"articleId":"monsters.monster.retainer.statblock.orc-charger","path":"Monsters/monster/retainer/statblock/orc-charger.md"},"originalId":"mcdm.monsters.v1/monster.retainer.statblock/orc-charger","originalName":"Orc Charger","originalDescription":"|   Humanoid, Orc   |         -         |      Level 1      |   Harrier Retainer    |         EV -         |\n|:-----------------:|:-----------------:|:-----------------:|:---------------------:|:--------------------:|\n|  **1M**<br>Size   |  **8**<br>Speed   | **21**<br>Stamina |  **0**<br>Stability   | **3**<br>Free Strike |\n| **-**<br>Immunity | **-**<br>Movement |         -         | **-**<br>With Captain |  **-**<br>Weakness   |\n|  **+2**<br>Might  | **+2**<br>Agility |  **0**<br>Reason  |  **0**<br>Intuition   |  **0**<br>Presence   |\n\n> ⚔️ **Notched Axe (Signature Ability)**\n>\n> | **Charge, Melee, Ranged, Strike, Weapon** |               **[Main action](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/turn)** |\n> |-------------------------------------------|------------------------------:|\n> | **📏 Melee 1 or ranged 5**                | **🎯 One creature or object** |\n>\n> **Power Roll + highest characteristic:**\n>\n> - **≤11:** 3 damage\n> - **12-16:** 5 damage\n> - **17+:** 7 damage\n\n> ⭐️ **Relentless**\n>\n> If the charger is reduced to 0 [Stamina](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.health/stamina), they can make a [free strike](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/feature.common.main-actions/free-strike) before dying. If the target of the [free strike](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/feature.common.main-actions/free-strike) is reduced to 0 [Stamina](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.health/stamina), the charger is reduced to 1 [Stamina](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.health/stamina) instead.","director":{"section":"retainers","sourcePath":"monster/retainer/statblock/orc-charger.json","sourceRevision":"bdb12093b1d